{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug cartels, corrupt police, manipulative media, and terror \u2014 all tied into one knot, pulled by a city hall rotten to its core. Here, people don\u2019t live \u2014 they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective, once a symbol of justice, now a forgotten drunk clinging to memories of better days. But the past won\u2019t let go, and the fate of the city suddenly falls into your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one person challenge the whole system \u2014 or will the city finally drown in darkness? And who is the shadow pushing you forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir pixel atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations from dark basements to a train speeding through a snowy desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2833880?t=1756604202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833880/12a51647e09fe8439f83b949e3ac758a9b608bf5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756604202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833880/e1f86df453c0294f2797850645b3c46851540e90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756604202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833880/e1f86df453c0294f2797850645b3c46851540e90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756604202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Contains occasional graphic violence & gore, some strong bad language and infrequent frontal nudity."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3961240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug cartels, corrupt police, manipulative media, and terror \u2014 all tied into one knot, pulled by a city hall rotten to its core. Here, people don\u2019t live \u2014 they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective, once a symbol of justice, now a forgotten drunk clinging to memories of better days. But the past won\u2019t let go, and the fate of the city suddenly falls into your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one person challenge the whole system \u2014 or will the city finally drown in darkness? And who is the shadow pushing you forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir pixel atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations from dark basements to a train speeding through a snowy desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul>","developers":["vonka"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833880/3e7711d7f7af12464bf6433688c6babbc4b85518/header.jpg?t=1756604202","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2833880/1364762710/d7f3c2b70ced76293dbe7a5088f6c5d1f9458694/1756041614/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756092502","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2833880/1364762710/d7f3c2b70ced76